      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5e44a1bd0c91c2477a8b8acb|full_name}: Communication is important, force is not the only option. This is true. However, persons having the capacity to perform necessary force is important, lest it be just a figurehead with no real authority, just a fancy color.",
